```js
AISYS.defineGame({
  schema: 1, kit: "endless-runner",
  id: "rimba-sprint", title: "Rimba Sprint", seed: "rimba-sprint-01",
  theme: { preset: "cartoon" },

  player: { x: 220, w: 44, h: 56, gravity: 2400, jumpVelocity: 900, lives: 3, invulnerableSec: 1.2 },
  world:  { groundY: 600, speed: 420, maxSpeed: 720, accel: 10 },

  spawner: {
    interval: [0.9, 1.5],
    table: [
      { type: "hazard", id: "batu-lumut",  w: 44, h: 48, weight: 3 },
      { type: "hazard", id: "genangan",    w: 90, h: 24, weight: 2 },
      { type: "hazard", id: "akar",        w: 70, h: 40, weight: 2 },
      { type: "item", weight: 5, heights: ["ground", "mid", "high"] }
    ]
  },

  rules: {
    perSecond: 5,
    correct: { score: 50, sfx: "coin" },
    wrong:   { score: -20, sfx: "hit", showExplain: false },
    hazard:  { lives: -1, sfx: "hit", shake: 10 },
    combo:   { step: 5, max: 4 },
    difficulty: { everySec: 12, speed: 30 }
  }
});
// END_OF_MANIFEST
```

Rimba Sprint adalah game arcade Endless Runner bertema hutan tropis basah dengan gaya Cartoon, di mana pemain melompati batu berlumut, genangan, dan akar sambil mengumpulkan koin. Karena mode arcade murni, blok `learning` tidak disertakan sehingga item berjalan sebagai koin skor generik.
